# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Questions about chances, rates, limits and the like ("what is the chance for rarity mobs") now show the current data pack setting instead of only wiki links
- Percent settings are shown as percentages, e.g. `10%` instead of `0.1`
- Nice Admin Tools gamerules are now included in the settings `/merl` can report on
- Existing `config/nicemerl.json` files pick up new default settings sources on update; entries you removed stay removed

## Fixes:
- `/merl` questions are no longer posted to Discord by Discord: JustSync, which mistook `/merl` for `/me`
